'''Mystery Club''' (ミステリーサークル部, ''Misuterī Sākuru Bu'', '''Mystery Circle Club''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].  It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

